Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:36.54,Hdr,,0,0,0,,June 24, 2001 - Takarazuka Kinen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:03.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,The battle for the straight - Meisho Doto already in front
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.80,0:00:07.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Meisho Doto leads - Hot Secret hanging on inside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:09.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Meisho Doto leads, Hot Secret second
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.70,0:00:12.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Third, out wide, Stay Gold and Air Shakur
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:15.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,At last T.M. Opera O charges down the far outside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.40,0:00:18.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Meisho Doto leads - T.M. Opera O outside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.70,0:00:22.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,T.M. Opera O! Meisho Doto leads - T.M. Opera O outside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:23.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Meisho Doto first!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:28.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Meisho Doto wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:32.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,At the sixth meeting, Meisho Doto finally beats T.M. Opera O
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.40,0:00:35.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,An indomitable run - his long-awaited G1 victory